    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963780/extras/5012e350f319b2f890f0341942988a4c.webp?t=1722009396\" /></div><br>Eldertrail is a turn-based strategy with rpg elements and adventure cards based exploration. You will take control of unique heroes, explore the world, build up your town, fight tactical battles, craft legendary weapons, level up and evolve your units and heroes to take out your opponents.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963780/extras/1ecd851fae04228e04656104dba92c80.webp?t=1722009396\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Three factions<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963780/extras/36be6a53f0782fdd8479ef9afe304c1d.avif?t=1722009396\" /></div></li><li>Units evolution<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963780/extras/115ecdb073414637d202c73dc1487ae8.avif?t=1722009396\" /></div></li><li>Crafting system with unique recipes<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963780/extras/558587f868a72e663fdec55f0f8aa11a.avif?t=1722009396\" /></div></li><li>Hundreds of artifacts</li><li>Adventure cards based exploration system</li><li>Deadly spells</li><li>Dozen of passive and active abbilities</li><li>Hot seat multiplayer for up to 3 players</li><li>Custom maps</li><li>Remote play together</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963780/extras/fe71de77f43ce2f76b4660a0f7d524ed.avif?t=1722009396\" /></div>",
